        {
          "text": "Ryeko onwoŋo orywenya oko two te maka, ate bu to kon piny pi kare abubup, icennere ate doŋ ya wot tiyo tic abaka, Ento abedo wuro gin ame aneno i waŋ lekkono meicel, dok naka mom aniaŋ gira iye.",
